<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe malaria deaths rise to over 320.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe malaria deaths rise to over 320.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some 39 people died from malaria this week, bringing Zimbabwe's malaria death toll this year to 321, the ministry of health reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement 185,133 malaria cases have been recorded countrywide from outbreaks triggered by recent heavy rains.</p>
</text>
